<title>UK: TABLE-EMI year pretax preexcept profit up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-EMI year pretax preexcept profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		53.1		   vs 49.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 30.0		   vs 27.0</p>
<p> Pretax  preexcept	380.5		  vs 367.3</p>
<p> Pretax		     283.9		  vs 376.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   3.39		   vs 3.52</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 370.0 and 385.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Results include restructuring charges of 117.2 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
